check 1
# Gold pickup: a gold pile made next to the player (poke item gld), picked up with 0x13 type 4 at frame 12; packets compares S->C 0x19 SmallGoldPickup and the stat updates (q-run-net, REC-1752).
name net-s2c-gold-pickup
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 40
seconds 240
channels packets
at 4 poke item gld @x+1 @y
at 12 send InteractWithEntity type=4 id=@4
